%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a9d446fdaefde204fbc683b0f43e403d, type: 3}
  m_Name: D6E1_ChairsEndingBossDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequence:
  - npcDialogueText: You fucked up really good, you know that?
    buttonText: I know
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: The waves were coming in, washing away the blood from the dock.
      duration: 7.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: We're both dead now. The guy who gave you that job too.
    buttonText: Why?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: But it wouldn't wash away what I'd done.
      duration: 6.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: Attempt to kill us? No, my boy. They will succeed.
    buttonText: Succeed?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: He was talking about the shadow behind the curtain.
      duration: 7.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: It's the people who organize this whole circus, the ones that
      brought most of us here.
    buttonText: Who are they?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: The unseen hands that kept this tavern running on that bloody island.
      duration: 8
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: We are all here for a reason, kid. Either you owe them something...
    buttonText: Owe them?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: A waiting room for the debtors
      duration: 6
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: Or you're in a conflict with somebody else, and they put you
      here until it's solved.
    buttonText: A prison?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: A purgatory where people were kept on ice until the world outside decided
        what to do with them
      duration: 10
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: Heck, if you have a plan, you can try to flee.
    buttonText: Flee?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: He didn't know about the Indian's boat, or the loony's route through
        the fog.
      duration: 8.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: But there's no way in hell you ever make it off this island.
    buttonText: I can try
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: To him, the horizon was just a wall painted blue.
      duration: 7.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: I can give you tasks, jobs, and pretend nothing happened. Not
      tell them a single thing about this.
    buttonText: Keep quiet?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: He wasn't saving my skin, he was saving his own.
      duration: 7
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: But they will find out. And when they do, I'm just as dead as
      you.
    buttonText: Why cover me?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: On this rock, a dead bartender was just as useless as a dead boss.
      duration: 7
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: My jobs, my cover... it won't last long.
    buttonText: How long?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: The clock was officially ticking.
      duration: 5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: If you have a plan to flee, or anything at all... well, you
      have two nights left.
    buttonText: Only two?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: Forty-eight hours before the owners of this place realized their new
        asset had been fed to the groupers.
      duration: 9.2
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: I can't cover you for more than that, kid. They will find out
      after two nights.
    buttonText: I get it
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: Two nights to get the boat and gather the crew.
      duration: 7
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: Make them count.
    buttonText: I will
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: And pray that bum really knew a way through the foam.
      duration: 8
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
